<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>go-slides – Cli</title><link>https://go-slides.github.io/docs/main/tags/cli/</link><description>Recent content in Cli on go-slides</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en</language><atom:link href="https://go-slides.github.io/docs/main/tags/cli/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Command line</title><link>https://go-slides.github.io/docs/main/cli/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://go-slides.github.io/docs/main/cli/</guid><description>
&lt;div class="hx:overflow-x-auto hx:mt-6 hx:flex hx:rounded-lg hx:border hx:py-2 hx:ltr:pr-4 hx:rtl:pl-4 hx:contrast-more:border-current hx:contrast-more:dark:border-current hx:border-amber-200 hx:bg-amber-100 hx:text-amber-900 hx:dark:border-amber-200/30 hx:dark:bg-amber-900/30 hx:dark:text-amber-200"&gt;
&lt;div class="hx:ltr:pl-3 hx:ltr:pr-2 hx:rtl:pr-3 hx:rtl:pl-2"&gt;&lt;svg height=1.2em class="hx:inline-block hx:align-middle" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"&gt;&lt;path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z"/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hx:w-full hx:min-w-0 hx:leading-7"&gt;
&lt;div class="hx:mt-6 hx:leading-7 hx:first:mt-0"&gt;Nothing is released yet. This page describes the command as it is being
written; it will be checked against the first release&amp;rsquo;s &lt;code&gt;slides -h&lt;/code&gt;, and
anything here may change before then.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-text" data-lang="text"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;slides [command] [flags] deck.md&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
aria-label="Copy code"
data-copied-label="Copied!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="commands"&gt;Commands&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="commands"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#commands" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Command&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th&gt;What it does&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;build&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;writes the presentation as HTML. &lt;strong&gt;The default&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;code&gt;slides deck.md&lt;/code&gt; is &lt;code&gt;slides build deck.md&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;expand&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;prints the deck as plain Marp Markdown: templates expanded, kinds replaced by the directives they stand for&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;notes&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;prints the speaker notes&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;kinds&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;lists the kinds the deck can use and what they set&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;themes&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;lists the themes&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;version&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;prints the version&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;slides &amp;lt;command&amp;gt; -h&lt;/code&gt; prints the flags of a command.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="flags"&gt;Flags&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="flags"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#flags" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;table&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Flag&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th&gt;Commands&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th&gt;What it does&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;-o file&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;all&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;output file; &lt;code&gt;-&lt;/code&gt; for standard output&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;--config file&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;all&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;configuration file; by default &lt;code&gt;slides.yaml&lt;/code&gt; next to the deck, if there is one&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;--no-config&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;all&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;do not read a configuration file&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;--theme-set path&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;all&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;a theme CSS file, or a directory of them (repeatable)&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;--kinds file&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;all but &lt;code&gt;themes&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;a YAML file of kinds (repeatable)&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;--data file&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;all but &lt;code&gt;themes&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;a YAML or JSON file of template data (repeatable)&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;--set key=value&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;all but &lt;code&gt;themes&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;one template value (repeatable)&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;--no-template&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;all but &lt;code&gt;themes&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;do not expand Go templates&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;--strict-yaml&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;all but &lt;code&gt;themes&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;parse directives as strict YAML, as plain Marpit does (Marp Core parses them loosely)&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;--html&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;build&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;allow all raw HTML; by default, Marp Core&amp;rsquo;s allowlist&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;--lang code&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;build&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;the page&amp;rsquo;s &lt;code&gt;lang&lt;/code&gt; when the deck sets none&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;--bare&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;build&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;stack the slides, without the presenting script&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="slidesyaml"&gt;&lt;code&gt;slides.yaml&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="slidesyaml"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#slidesyaml" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;A configuration file next to the deck applies to it, so a folder of decks
shares one:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-code-block hx:relative hx:mt-6 hx:first:mt-0 hx:group/code"&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-yaml" data-lang="yaml"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;kinds&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="l"&gt;kinds.yaml &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="c"&gt;# a mapping of kinds, or file(s) holding one&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;themes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="c"&gt;# theme CSS files or directories&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;- &lt;span class="l"&gt;themes/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;data&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="c"&gt;# template data&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;company&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="l"&gt;Example Inc.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;html&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="kc"&gt;false&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="c"&gt;# allow all raw HTML&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nt"&gt;lang&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="w"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="l"&gt;en&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="hextra-code-copy-btn-container hx:opacity-0 hx:transition hx:group-hover/code:opacity-100 hx:flex hx:gap-1 hx:absolute hx:m-[11px] hx:right-0 hx:top-0"&gt;
&lt;button
class="hextra-code-copy-btn hx:group/copybtn hx:cursor-pointer hx:transition-all hx:active:opacity-50 hx:bg-primary-700/5 hx:border hx:border-black/5 hx:text-gray-600 hx:hover:text-gray-900 hx:rounded-md hx:p-1.5 hx:dark:bg-primary-300/10 hx:dark:border-white/10 hx:dark:text-gray-400 hx:dark:hover:text-gray-50"
title="Copy code"
aria-label="Copy code"
data-copied-label="Copied!"
&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-copy-icon hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:hidden hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="hextra-success-icon hx:hidden hx:group-[.copied]/copybtn:block hx:pointer-events-none hx:h-4 hx:w-4"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kinds: the deck&amp;rsquo;s own &lt;code&gt;kinds:&lt;/code&gt; override the file&amp;rsquo;s and the command line&amp;rsquo;s.
Data: the file&amp;rsquo;s and the command line&amp;rsquo;s &lt;code&gt;data&lt;/code&gt; override the deck&amp;rsquo;s front
matter, so one deck can be built with different data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-hextra-search-id="planned"&gt;Planned&lt;span class="hx:absolute hx:-mt-20" id="planned"&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;a href="#planned" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Not in the first release: image (PNG/JPEG), PDF and PPTX output, math and
code highlighting. When they arrive, they are commands or flags here.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>